[[SECTION]]
TITLE: About

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Project: RO3 (Ragnarok 3 in ROOGuildApp). Strictly isolated from ROO (Ragnarok Origin): every relation in this document points at RO3 nodes only. Origin counterparts appear as plain text (counterpart …) and are never links.
Source: SSOT requirements/usr (published only).
Published nodes: 9 (USR-RO3-001 .. USR-RO3-009).
SSOT sync 2026-10-10 (JST): graph 91; source xWhiteSpace/ROOGuildApp@f38e1378c7cca457fbf8de8e8355d59994f77fc8. Published in SSOT ≠ proven; no EVD; every TST is execution_status blocked_on_tooling, evidence_status none.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Games/Access (USR-RO3-001)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: USR-RO3-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Turn Ragnarok 3 on for a workspace
STATEMENT: >>>
Add Ragnarok 3 as its own game in the workspace and keep its pages and data closed unless the game is enabled.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Guilds that also play Ragnarok 3 want one workspace without mixing it with Origin.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Games/Access
who: Officers
why: Guilds that also play Ragnarok 3 want one workspace without mixing it with Origin.
spoken_constraints: Ragnarok 3 is independent of Origin.; Ragnarok 3 has no auction or request features.; Ragnarok 3 data is Ragnarok 3-only and Origin data is Origin-only; neither game reads or writes the other's data.
ssot_status: published
sot: xWhiteSpace/ROOGuildApp@f38e1378c7cca457fbf8de8e8355d59994f77fc8
counterpart (text only, not a link): USR-ROO-011, USR-ROO-012
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Settings (USR-RO3-002)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: USR-RO3-002
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Ragnarok 3 guild settings
STATEMENT: >>>
Keep Ragnarok 3 settings (events, raid cycles, jobs, roles, grid size, help links) separate from Origin, with no auction catalog.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
R3 has no Mimic Book auction; its config must not overwrite Origin's.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Settings
who: Officers
why: R3 has no Mimic Book auction; its config must not overwrite Origin's.
spoken_constraints: (none)
ssot_status: published
sot: xWhiteSpace/ROOGuildApp@f38e1378c7cca457fbf8de8e8355d59994f77fc8
counterpart (text only, not a link): USR-ROO-024 (settings), USR-ROO-040 (defaults)
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

