[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Discord (USR-RO3-009)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: USR-RO3-009
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Ragnarok 3 on Discord
STATEMENT: >>>
Use the guild's Discord server for Ragnarok 3: the Ragnarok 3 roster follows Discord membership, officers post Ragnarok 3's own cards to Discord, and presses on those cards are handled by Ragnarok 3.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Discord is where the guild already is; customer decided Ragnarok 3 uses Discord and Discord is the member source of truth.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord
who: Officers and members
why: Discord is where the guild already is; customer decided Ragnarok 3 uses Discord and Discord is the member source of truth.
spoken_constraints: Discord is the member source of truth for Ragnarok 3.; Ragnarok 3 renders its own Discord cards.; Ragnarok 3 card presses are handled by Ragnarok 3, never by the Origin handler.; Card deploys are game-gated and never touch another game's data or cards.
ssot_status: published
sot: xWhiteSpace/ROOGuildApp@f38e1378c7cca457fbf8de8e8355d59994f77fc8
counterpart (text only, not a link): USR-ROO-018 (interactions), USR-ROO-019 (deploy cards), USR-ROO-023 (roster sync)
<<<

